= Genoa Conference

An international economic conference is held to address major economic and political issues revolving around europe and to address the status of Germany and the Soviet Union, both of which have been excluded from the Paris Conference in 1919.

The conference was also held to negotiate and build a relationship between Western Europe and Eastern Europe.

Poland is represented through it's formal delegates led by the Foreign Minister, [+ foreign_minister +].

- @firstthingsfirst

